Reviewed-by: Ming-Ying Chung <mych@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ming-Ying Chung <mych@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1726719}
(cherry picked from commit ff5f2bcd571e33a322513ac72b841041e7e57687)

